note The index crate: building the domain's Index from the source tree. It owns the two backends and the linking: tree-sitter parsing and highlighting (parse.rs), the language-server orchestration over io-lsp (server.rs), call sites resolved into callees and callers (link.rs), and build, which walks through io-source and reuses io-cache. The CLI and the GUI use only this surface; each piece's workflow is its own path, linked from the step that names it.

